Stopped after exhausting the reachable surface.

- Enumerated 278 subdomains (46 resolve); mapped brand, API, help, `startN`, S3, and DNS surfaces.
- All dynamic hosts are geo-blocked at CloudFront (`403 {"error":"access blocked"}`, `503 bb-rsn: bc`, or empty 503). The only served JS is a fixed 403-page renderer; no app routes, APIs, or signup were reachable, so test accounts could not be created.
- No confirmed high-impact finding. `result/confirmed-vuln.txt` remains empty.
- Informational/excluded: `VULN-20261029-001` public S3 bucket listings (static assets only, no write) and `VULN-20261029-002` dangling CNAMEs to a deleted ELB/CloudFront (not claimable).
- Unresolved lead: `VULN-20261029-003` — `loop.sptpub.com` → `127.0.0.1` (potential `*.sptpub.com` SSRF allowlist bypass, untestable while the API is blocked).
- Full inventory, evidence, ledgers, and reports are under `result/`; see `result/SUMMARY.md`.
